%% Sequence 1: bike intake at the front desk.
sequenceDiagram
  actor Desk as Front desk
  participant Shell as JavaFX shell
  participant Kernel
  participant Store as Storage
  participant Bus as Event bus
  participant Print as Print plugin
  participant Printer

  Desk->>Shell: customer phone
  Shell->>Kernel: find customer
  Kernel->>Store: search by phone
  Store-->>Kernel: customer and bikes
  Shell->>Kernel: create order (complaint, photos, due date)
  Kernel->>Store: save, status Accepted
  Kernel-->>Shell: order number
  Kernel->>Bus: OrderAccepted (after commit)
  Bus->>Print: event
  Print->>Printer: intake receipt and bike tag with QR
  Shell-->>Desk: order number, printing
